      *****************************************************************
      * PROGRAM:     STU1001                                          *
      * SYSTEM:      SMART SCHOLARSHIP ELIGIBILITY & DISBURSEMENT     *
      * MODULE:      STUDENT APPLICATION RECORD VALIDATOR             *
      * AUTHOR:      MAINFRAME ARCHITECT & COBOL SPECIALIST           *
      * ENVIRONMENT: IBM ENTERPRISE COBOL FOR z/OS                    *
      * PURPOSE:     VALIDATE INCOMING APPLICATION FIELDS FOR FORMAT, *
      *              MANDATORY CONTENT, AND BOUNDARY CHECKS.          *
      * RETURN CODES:                                                 *
      *   00 - RECORD IS CLEAN AND VALID                              *
      *   04 - MINOR WARNING (DATA PRESENT BUT PADDED)                *
      *   08 - VALIDATION ERROR (INVALID FIELD VALUE)                 *
      *   12 - SEVERE ERROR (MISSING MANDATORY DATA)                  *
      *****************************************************************
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STU1001.
       AUTHOR. SENIOR MAINFRAME DEVELOPER.
       INSTALLATION. ENTERPRISE ACADEMIC SYSTEMS.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 2024-10-15.
       DATE-COMPILED. 2024-10-15.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-ZOS.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-ZOS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONSTANTS.
           05  WS-PGM-NAME             PIC X(08) VALUE 'STU1001 '.
           05  WS-MIN-CGPA-POSSIBLE    PIC 9(02)V99 VALUE 00.00.
           05  WS-MAX-CGPA-POSSIBLE    PIC 9(02)V99 VALUE 10.00.
           05  WS-MIN-ATTN-POSSIBLE    PIC 9(03)V99 VALUE 000.00.
           05  WS-MAX-ATTN-POSSIBLE    PIC 9(03)V99 VALUE 100.00.
           05  WS-MAX-INCOME-CEILING   PIC 9(08)V99 VALUE 99999999.99.

       01  WS-INTERNAL-COUNTERS.
           05  WS-CHARS-CHECKED        PIC 9(02) VALUE ZERO.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
      * --- APPLICATION INPUT RECORD COPYBOOK ---
       COPY SCHAPP.

      * --- VALIDATION COMMUNICATION AREA ---
       01  LS-STU-VAL-COMM-AREA.
           05  LS-VAL-RETURN-CODE      PIC 9(04).
               88  LS-VAL-RC-SUCCESS   VALUE 0000.
               88  LS-VAL-RC-WARN      VALUE 0004.
               88  LS-VAL-RC-ERROR     VALUE 0008.
               88  LS-VAL-RC-SEVERE    VALUE 0012.
           05  LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD      PIC X(16).
           05  LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON     PIC X(40).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING SCHOLARSHIP-APP-RECORD
                                LS-STU-VAL-COMM-AREA.

       0000-MAIN-VALIDATION.
           INITIALIZE LS-STU-VAL-COMM-AREA
           SET LS-VAL-RC-SUCCESS TO TRUE
           MOVE SPACES TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
           MOVE SPACES TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON

           PERFORM 1000-VALIDATE-MANDATORY-FIELDS
           IF NOT LS-VAL-RC-SUCCESS
               GOBACK
           END-IF

           PERFORM 2000-VALIDATE-DATA-FORMATS
           IF NOT LS-VAL-RC-SUCCESS
               GOBACK
           END-IF

           PERFORM 3000-VALIDATE-NUMERIC-RANGES

           GOBACK.

       1000-VALIDATE-MANDATORY-FIELDS.
      *    CHECK FOR BLANK OR MISSING APPLICATION ID
           IF APP-ID = SPACES OR APP-ID = LOW-VALUES
               SET LS-VAL-RC-SEVERE TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-ID' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'APPLICATION ID IS MANDATORY' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    CHECK FOR BLANK OR MISSING STUDENT ID
           IF APP-STU-ID = SPACES OR APP-STU-ID = LOW-VALUES
               SET LS-VAL-RC-SEVERE TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-STU-ID' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'STUDENT ID IS MANDATORY' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    CHECK FOR BLANK SCHOLARSHIP CODE
           IF APP-SCH-CODE = SPACES
               SET LS-VAL-RC-SEVERE TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-SCH-CODE' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'SCHOLARSHIP CODE IS MANDATORY'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    CHECK FOR BLANK BANK ACCOUNT NUMBER
           IF APP-BANK-AC-NUM = SPACES
               SET LS-VAL-RC-SEVERE TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-BANK-AC-NUM' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'BANK ACCOUNT NUMBER IS MANDATORY'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    CHECK FOR BLANK IFSC CODE
           IF APP-BANK-IFSC = SPACES
               SET LS-VAL-RC-SEVERE TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-BANK-IFSC' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'BANK IFSC CODE IS MANDATORY'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF.

       2000-VALIDATE-DATA-FORMATS.
      *    STUDENT ID PREFIX VERIFICATION (MUST START WITH 'STU')
           IF APP-STU-ID(1:3) NOT = 'STU'
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-STU-ID' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'STUDENT ID MUST BEGIN WITH STU PREFIX'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    STUDENT ID SUFFIX MUST BE NUMERIC
           IF APP-STU-ID(4:7) NOT NUMERIC
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-STU-ID' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'STUDENT ID TRAILING 7 CHARS NOT NUM'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    APPLICATION ID PREFIX VERIFICATION (MUST START WITH 'APP')
           IF APP-ID(1:3) NOT = 'APP'
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-ID' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'APPLICATION ID MUST BEGIN WITH APP'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    SUBMISSION DATE MUST BE NUMERIC YYYYMMDD
           IF APP-DATE NOT NUMERIC
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-DATE' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'APPLICATION DATE IS NOT NUMERIC YMD'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF.

       3000-VALIDATE-NUMERIC-RANGES.
      *    CGPA RANGE VALIDATION (0.00 TO 10.00)
           IF APP-CGPA < WS-MIN-CGPA-POSSIBLE OR
              APP-CGPA > WS-MAX-CGPA-POSSIBLE
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-CGPA' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'CGPA OUT OF VALID RANGE 0.00-10.00'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    ATTENDANCE PERCENTAGE VALIDATION (0.00 TO 100.00)
           IF APP-ATTENDANCE < WS-MIN-ATTN-POSSIBLE OR
              APP-ATTENDANCE > WS-MAX-ATTN-POSSIBLE
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-ATTENDANCE' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'ATTENDANCE OUT OF RANGE 0-100%'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    ANNUAL INCOME MUST BE NUMERIC AND REALISTIC
           IF APP-FAMILY-INCOME > WS-MAX-INCOME-CEILING
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-INCOME' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'FAMILY INCOME EXCEEDS SYSTEM CEILING'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF

      *    ACTIVE ARREARS MUST BE NON-NEGATIVE
           IF APP-ACTIVE-ARREARS NOT NUMERIC
               SET LS-VAL-RC-ERROR TO TRUE
               MOVE 'APP-ARREARS' TO LS-VAL-ERROR-FIELD
               MOVE 'ACTIVE ARREARS MUST BE NUMERIC'
                 TO LS-VAL-ERROR-REASON
               EXIT PARAGRAPH
           END-IF.
